{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 7, "ref": "genesis 43:7", "book": "genesis", "lang": "id", "chapter": 43, "translation": "Dan mereka berkata, “Bertanya-tanya ditanyakan ⟨lah⟩ orang itu kepada kami dan kepada keluarga kami, katanya: Apakah ayahmu masih hidup? Adakah padamu saudara?” Dan kami beritahukan kepadanya menurut ⟨isi⟩ perkataan-perkataan ini. ⟩Bagaimana kami tahu bahwa ia akan berkata, Turunkanlah ⟨את⟩ saudaramu?⟨”", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויאמרו", "gloss": "dan mereka berkata"}, {"surface": "שאול", "gloss": "bertanya-tanya"}, {"surface": "שאל", "gloss": "ditanyakan"}, {"surface": "האיש", "gloss": "orang itu"}, {"surface": "לנו", "gloss": "kepada kami"}, {"surface": "ולמולדתנו", "gloss": "dan kepada keluarga kami"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "katanya"}, {"surface": "העוד", "gloss": "apakah masih"}, {"surface": "אביכם", "gloss": "ayahmu"}, {"surface": "חי", "gloss": "hidup"}, {"surface": "היש", "gloss": "adakah"}, {"surface": "לכם", "gloss": "padamu"}, {"surface": "אח", "gloss": "saudara"}, {"surface": "ונגד", "gloss": "dan kami beritahukan"}, {"surface": "לו", "gloss": "kepadanya"}, {"surface": "על", "gloss": "menurut"}, {"surface": "פי", "gloss": "⟨isi⟩"}, {"surface": "הדברים", "gloss": "perkataan-perkataan"}, {"surface": "האלה", "gloss": "ini"}, {"surface": "הידוע", "gloss": "apakah diketahui"}, {"surface": "נדע", "gloss": "kami tahu"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "bahwa"}, {"surface": "יאמר", "gloss": "ia akan berkata"}, {"surface": "הורידו", "gloss": "turunkanlah"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "saudaramu"}, {"surface": "אחיכם", "gloss": "saudaramu"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-08T10:25:32.137167057Z", "model": "glm-5.2"}